<title>ISRAEL: Israel grain, meal, soy arrivals detailed.</title>
<headline>Israel grain, meal, soy arrivals detailed.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following shipments of grain have arrived or are due to arrive in Israeli ports, according to the inspection agency Hevra Klalit Lehashgaha (in tonnes):</p>
<p>Vessel	     ETA	   Cargo	    Quantity   Origin</p>
<p>Unlo		 19/11	 sunflower meal  2,500     Europe</p>
<p>Volgobal 234     20/11	 feed wheat	3,013     Europe</p>
<p>Bodaibo	    21/11	 rapeseeds	 2,200     Ukraine</p>
<p>Volgobal 186     23/11	 bran		2,550     Europe</p>
<p>Floriana	   23/11	 barley	   11,261     Europe</p>
<p>Grigorousa	 27/11	 sorghum	  14,426     U.S.</p>
<p>				     soya	     15,517</p>
<p>				     corn		7,510</p>
<p>Yoanis	     05/12	 wheat+soya     60,000     U.S.</p>
<p>Liberty Sea	20/12	 na		 60,000     U.S.</p>
</text>
